# [@Integer x] in direct match arm key position is not a supported pattern form.
# SurfaceExpression::TypeAssert hits match_pattern's _ => Err("not a valid pattern: @Type").
# The @[is: ...] guard form is only supported in CaseArm position via eval_structural_pattern_inner.
[match "hello"
  [@Integer x]: x
  ...: "not-int"]
=== error
not a valid pattern: @Type
